#X text 61 31 x.darray~ - manage multiple named arrays;
#X text 61 66 create <name> [size]: add and select an array. Default size is 1;
#X text 61 91 set <name>: select an array created by this object.;
#X text 61 391 Click the object or send open to show the selected array.;
#X text 61 421 Deleting the selected array selects the most recently created remaining array.;
#X text 61 461 All owned arrays are freed when this object is destroyed.;
#X text 61 491 Array names must be unique. Other objects' arrays cannot be set or deleted.;
